# Only server/, web/, deploy/docker/, the shared cases the web tests read (spec/fixtures/), the extension schema
# the web build uses (schema/extension/) and the runtime packages' sources (integrations/, go generate) go into the hub
# image (Dockerfile).
*
!server/
!web/
!deploy/docker/
!integrations/agent-sdk/
!integrations/dsh/
!integrations/paseo/
!integrations/pi/
!integrations/runtime-sdk/
# the extension SDK's wire types: server/go.mod replaces its module with ../sdk/go (Dockerfile)
!sdk/go/
# the shared cases the web app's tests import: the web build's tsc checks the tests too (Dockerfile)
!spec/fixtures/
# the extension schema and its examples: the web app builds them in and its tests import them (Dockerfile)
!schema/extension/
integrations/**/node_modules/
server/bin/
server/internal/hub/webdist/*
!server/internal/hub/webdist/README.md
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/public/pake/client.wasm
web/public/pake/wasm_exec.js
web/public/pake/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
# A hub run from this folder: its secrets and data (docs/operations/docker.md).
deploy/docker/.env
deploy/docker/data/
deploy/docker/postgres/
**/.DS_Store
